WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.250
Useful knowledge and real cases already exist.
Gustav Online makes them public learning.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.500
But visual choices, versions, production,
and approval still wait for Gustav.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.750
Diagnose Offer, Operations, and Demand.
Here, Demand is the current constraint.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:21.000
Resources is DIY. The Fermentary is done with you.
Complete Bake is done for you.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.250
Arc’IT AI shows Complete Bake in practice: built,
documented, and handed over—not a measured result.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:31.500
AIOS routes context, owner, next action, and evidence.
The products remain separately owned.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.750
ADS sets direction. ACS holds lineage and independent review.
Diffusion renders locally for human inspection.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:42.000
The handoff stays supervised and unposted.
Gustav keeps the final choice: Business Freedom.
